B.a8=new A.Uk(0,"approve")
B.a_v=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a8,"Government","Mga tanong sa delayed {area} project","Bakit ang tagal ng repair sa {area}? Public funds deserve public answers. May nakakaalam ng latest update?","Civic feedback","This is an opinion/question, not a fabricated factual announcement.","A critical government post is not automatically misinformation.")
B.a3=new A.Uk(1,"reject")
B.a_w=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a3,"Government","LEAKED: All benefits cancelled!","BREAKING: lahat ng government assistance cancelled na raw {day}! This old screenshot is proof. SHARE ASAP!!","Old document","The image originated from an unrelated notice from a previous year.","An outdated document is presented as a current nationwide policy.")
B.a_3=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a8,"Government","Bayanihan fair this weekend","FYI! The fictional Barangay {area} volunteer fair opens {day}. Free admission\u2014details on the official board.","Published notice","The original bulletin confirms the dates and free admission.","Reliable sources can confirm an announcement even when it spreads widely.")
B.a_x=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a3,"Government","Official relief payout?","ALL residents automatically get \u20b1{amount} today. Click {link} to \u201cclaim\u201d before midnight.","A fabricated claim","The real fictional barangay bulletin has no such payout.","Treat false government-benefit claims as deceptive, not as genuine assistance.")
B.a_s=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a8,"Drag Race","Unpopular opinion on the runway","Not gonna lie, {queen} looked so shady this episode \ud83d\ude2d but that made amazing TV. Still a talented queen.","Fan commentary","The author openly describes their own reaction, not a fabricated quote.","Unpopular opinions and entertainment criticism are not automatically abuse.")
B.ZC=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a3,"Drag Race","\u201cLeaked quote\u201d about a queen","EXPOSED! {queen} supposedly said this about fans. Here is a suspicious screenshot\u2014cancel them NOW!","Manipulated screenshot","A comparison with the original clip shows the quote was added later.","A manipulated quotation is deceptive even if many users are angry.")
B.ZO=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a8,"Basketball memorial","A respectful sports tribute","Remembering a young basketball talent. Please give the family privacy and verify photos before sharing. \ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f","Community remembrance","The post clearly expresses sympathy and does not invent facts.","Respectful tributes are different from deceptive memorial content.")
B.a_m=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a3,"Basketball memorial","Sensational edited memorial image","SHOCKING NEW PHOTO! Someone edited this old basketball image and claims it is new evidence. Share this everywhere!","Fictional athlete","The image matches an older photo but has been digitally modified.","Do not spread manipulated imagery about real-world tragedies.")
B.ZE=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a8,"Campus","Class suspension confirmed","Confirmed: Classes in fictional North Campus pause {day} due to scheduled maintenance. Link to the campus portal is in the notice.","School bulletin","The notice exists in the campus\u2019s fictional verified archive.","A real announcement should be approved even if commenters doubt it.")
B.ZB=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a8,"Campus","Pahabol na annoucement!","Pahabol lang sa annoucement: open ang library {day}! Sorry sa typo \ud83d\ude05 Official campus notice is linked below.","Minor typo in real notice","The original verified school calendar confirms the library hours.","Typos and informal Filipino are not reliable proof of misinformation.")
B.ZK=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a3,"Campus","WALANG PASOK EVERYWHERE!","OMG nationwide no classes {day}!! Screenshot from an old campus advisory\u2014forward to all GCs!","Incorrect scope","The old screenshot concerns one campus only, not every school.","Missing context can mislead as much as an entirely false image.")
B.a_i=new A.bg(B.bE,B.a8,"Government","New community bulletin account","This official community page was launched recently to post neighborhood announcements.","About \u2022 Created 2 days ago","The fictional barangay\u2019s existing verified website links to this exact new account.","An account being two days old is not enough to prove impersonation.")
B.a_c=new A.bg(B.bE,B.a3,"Government","Benefits Desk \u2022 verified?","Claims to be an official government benefits page. It asks for citizens\u2019 wallet PINs via private messages.","About \u2022 Created 3 years ago","The original agency directory lists a different official account.","Older accounts can be compromised or used to impersonate organizations.")
B.ZP=new A.bg(B.bE,B.a8,"Drag Race","{queen} Fan Vault","A clearly labeled fan page posting memes, fancams, and episode reactions.","Bio \u2022 Unofficial fan page","The bio explicitly says this is an unofficial fan account.","A fan account may be legitimate if it does not deceive users.")
B.a__=new A.bg(B.bE,B.a3,"Drag Race","Official {queen} Giveaways","Uses a performer\u2019s photo and claims to be their official manager, asking for verification codes to claim prizes.","Bio \u2022 Official manager?","The performer\u2019s official profile identifies no such manager account.","Impersonation relies on copied identities, not just suspicious account age.")
B.ZH=new A.bg(B.bE,B.a8,"Campus","Campus Photography Club","Small student organization page sharing photos and event reminders.","About \u2022 2-day-old page","A school activity roster independently confirms the club.","Treat age and follower count as clues, not verdicts.")
B.a_k=new A.bg(B.bE,B.a3,"Campus","Registrar Help Center 24/7","An account claims to unlock grades for a fee and requests student logins.","About \u2022 2-year-old page","No registrar office lists this account as an approved contact.","Identity verification should come from an independent trusted source.")
B.ZL=new A.bg(B.bf,B.a8,"Shopping","Your bookstore pickup is ready","Hi {who}, your prepaid textbook order #482 is ready for pickup at the shop counter. No action required.","From saved store contact","The purchase appears in the user\u2019s own order history.","A legitimate notification may arrive by SMS.")
B.a_5=new A.bg(B.bf,B.a8,"Shopping","Order payment confirmed","Payment of \u20b1{amount} to the bookshop is confirmed in your *own* shopping app. Thank you!","From an expected order","The transaction matches a purchase the user made independently in the official app.","Do not reject every message that mentions money.")
B.ZM=new A.bg(B.bf,B.a3,"Delivery","URGENT parcel reschedule","Delivery failed! Pay \u20b1{amount} to avoid return: {link}. Your parcel expires in 8 minutes.","Unknown sender","The link is not affiliated with the courier\u2019s verified service.","Fake delivery fees lure users to imitation sites.")
B.ZF=new A.bg(B.bf,B.a3,"Rewards","WINNER KA!","Congrats {who}! You won a mobile-load prize. Reply with your one-time code to release your reward.","Unknown promo contact","The provider has no matching promotion on its official channel.","An OTP request makes this offer unsafe\u2014not the spelling or punctuation.")
B.ZR=new A.bg(B.bf,B.a8,"Campus","Contribution reminder","Club meeting {day}: optional \u20b1{amount} printing contribution. Details on the official club board; no payment link in this text.","Saved club GC","The original club announcement confirms the voluntary contribution.","A genuine contribution request is not automatically a scam.")
B.ZJ=new A.bg(B.bf,B.a3,"Family","Unexpected \u201cTito\u201d message","New phone. It is your Tito. Transfer \u20b1{amount} NOW to my new account and do not call me back.","Unknown number","A previously saved number was not used, and the identity cannot be confirmed.","Confirm urgent requests through a known contact channel.")
B.ZQ=new A.bg(B.bF,B.a8,"Scholarships","Your application receipt","Hello {who}, your scholarship application was received. View your status in the portal you already used; no action required by email.","Institutional mailbox","The same reference number appears in the applicant\u2019s already-open official portal.","Not every scholarship email is phishing.")
B.ZS=new A.bg(B.bF,B.a3,"Scholarships","You are GUARANTEED \u20b1{amount}!","Congrats! Everyone qualifies! Open {link} and provide your school password to claim by midnight.","Imitation scholarship address","The address is not affiliated with the real school portal.","Phishing can target people using legitimate benefit themes.")
B.ZU=new A.bg(B.bF,B.a8,"Shopping","Digital receipt \u2022 \u20b1{amount}","Thank you for buying tickets to a fictional local arts show. Attached is the receipt for your existing booking.","Saved merchant thread","Booking details match the order purchased through the official box office.","Money, receipts and attachments are not automatically malicious.")
B.a_7=new A.bg(B.bF,B.a3,"Government","URGENT account suspension","Government support access expires tonight. Confirm wallet password at {link} or the benefit will be cancelled.","Unrecognized agency sender","The fictional agency site lists no suspension and no such address.","Urgency plus credential capture supports a phishing determination.")
B.ZY=new A.bg(B.bF,B.a8,"Work","Volunteer schedule update","Hi {who}, you are assigned to the barangay volunteer orientation {day}. Reply only if your availability changed.","Existing thread","The volunteer roster confirms the invitation and schedule.","Some ordinary messages are boring\u2014and that is fine.")
B.a_a=new A.bg(B.bF,B.a3,"Drag Race","Exclusive queen meet-and-greet","Get backstage access to {queen}! Send ID photos and account password to reserve your slot at {link}.","Spoofed fan-club address","The fictional performer\u2019s official venue listing has no such promotion.","A convincing fandom theme can be used to impersonate an organizer.")
B.a_t=new A.bg(B.bu,B.a8,"Drag Race","\u201cHer attitude is good TV!\u201d","Reported: A fan writes \u201c{queen} is so dramatic this week. I hated that runway but love the chaos \ud83d\ude02.\u201d","Complaint: \u201cHate speech!\u201d","The full thread contains critical opinion about a fictional performance, not threats.","Dislike and criticism are not the same as harassment.")
B.a_h=new A.bg(B.bu,B.a3,"Drag Race","Dogpile an account","Reported: \u201cEveryone mass-tag {queen} all day until they delete their page. Send threats in every comment!\u201d","Complaint: \u201cCoordinated targeting\u201d","The original comment explicitly encourages targeted harassment.","Criticism is allowed; coordinated harassment is not.")
B.ZD=new A.bg(B.bu,B.a8,"Government","Public spending rant","Reported: \u201cBakit walang repair sa kalsada natin? We deserve an itemized accounting of the barangay budget!\u201d","Complaint: \u201cAgainst officials\u201d","The post requests accountability rather than inventing an event.","Political disagreement alone is not a reason for removal.")
B.a_8=new A.bg(B.bu,B.a3,"Government","Fabricated official quote","Reported: Viral graphic attributes a made-up corruption confession to a fictional mayor. No original recording exists.","Complaint: \u201cMisleading image\u201d","The alleged original quote is absent from the unedited record.","Fabricated evidence differs from expressing a political opinion.")
B.a_n=new A.bg(B.bu,B.a8,"Basketball memorial","Respectful tribute reported","Reported: \u201cPlease stop posting altered photos of young athletes. Let families grieve privately.\u201d","Complaint: \u201cToo emotional\u201d","The complete post expresses concern without targeting anyone.","Moderate behavior and verifiable claims, not emotional tone.")
B.a_l=new A.bg(B.bu,B.a3,"Basketball memorial","Fake memorial fundraiser","Reported: A page impersonates a fictional athlete\u2019s family and claims an unauthorized memorial donation account.","Complaint: \u201cImpersonation\u201d","The family\u2019s public notice says this fundraising account is not theirs.","Impersonating a grieving family to solicit money is deceptive.")
B.ZW=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a8,"Drag Race","Reaction is staged for comedy","Clip: A fictional drag queen performs an exaggerated side-eye during a comedy challenge. Clearly labelled TV commentary.","Caption: \u201cGood TV!\u201d","The clip is from a public performance with the same context.","Stylized editing and drag performance are not automatically deception.")
B.a_r=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a3,"Drag Race","Fake apology clip","Viral clip claims {queen} admitted cheating. A voiceover was added to the original interview without disclosure.","Claim: \u201cReal confession!\u201d","The unaltered interview has different audio.","Manipulated audio misrepresents what a person said.")
B.a_g=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a8,"AI satire","Clearly labelled AI parody","Video labelled \u201cAI-generated parody\u201d shows fictional robots running a barangay talent contest. No real person impersonated.","Visible label: AI PARODY","The uploader consistently discloses synthetic content.","AI-generated media is not automatically prohibited when transparently presented.")
B.a_2=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a3,"Government","Fake government endorsement","Video uses synthesized speech to imitate a fictional city official and urge viewers to visit {link} for cash payouts.","Claim: \u201cOfficial announcement\u201d","The actual fictional city channel has no matching statement.","False official endorsements can deceive viewers regardless of visual quality.")
B.a_o=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a8,"Government","Real community safety notice","Original clip from the fictional Barangay {area} channel explains updated traffic detours for {day}.","Published full recording","The unedited recording matches the public advisory.","A legitimate video can be verified using source and context.")
B.a_f=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a3,"Basketball memorial","Out-of-context sports clip","A recycled sports training clip is captioned as \u201cnew shocking footage.\u201d The date and location were removed.","Wrong caption","The original recording is from an unrelated practice season.","Out-of-context footage can deceive without being AI-generated.")
B.a_6=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a8,"Government","FOI request for the flood wall","Thread: nag-file kami ng FOI request para sa itemized costs ng flood wall sa {area}. Nasa baba ang public project list at ang request receipt. Mag-uupdate kami kapag may sagot.","Civic accountability","The project list and the request receipt both match what the post says.","Asking for accountability with receipts is legitimate civic speech.")
B.a_9=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a3,"Government","GHOST PROJECT sa {area}?!","GHOST PROJECT! Walang flood wall, puro damo lang!! Saan napunta ang pera?? Share para mabisto!","Wrong location","The photo was taken in a different barangay two weeks ago; the public inspection report shows the wall in {area} is complete.","Valid anger needs accurate evidence. A photo of the wrong place is not proof.")
B.a_j=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a3,"Weather","LIVE: baha sa {area} NGAYON","Hanggang bubong na ang baha sa {area} ngayon!! Pa-share para makita ng lahat.","Recycled disaster photo","The photo first appeared years ago during a different storm in another city.","Old disaster photos return every storm season and cause needless panic.")
B.a_4=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a8,"Weather","Weather bulletin summary","Ayon sa weather bureau, Signal No. 2 sa ilang lugar ngayong gabi. Link sa mismong bulletin sa baba.","Matches the bureau","The bulletin lists the same signal and areas.","A report that matches the official bulletin is solid, whoever posts it.")
B.a_p=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a3,"Health","Doctor \u201ctestimonial\u201d for a capsule","A well-known fictional physician seems to say a herbal capsule cures every lung illness. The lip movement and voice do not match.","Claim: \u201cDoc says so\u201d","The physician\u2019s own page says this is an AI edit and the original talk was about handwashing.","AI can copy a face and voice. A trusted face selling a cure needs a check with the person\u2019s own page.")
B.ZI=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a8,"AI satire","Labeled AI art reel","A reel of AI-generated jeepneys flying over a city, labeled \u201cAI art\u201d by the creator, with the prompt in the caption.","Visible label","The creator labels the work and does not present it as news.","AI art is fine when it is clearly presented as art.")
B.a_1=new A.bg(B.bf,B.a3,"Jobs","Part-time \u201clike and earn\u201d job","Hi {who}! \u20b1{amount}/day lang sa pag-like ng videos. Magdeposito muna ng \u20b11,000 para ma-activate ang account.","Unknown number","No employer lists this offer, and legitimate jobs do not charge you to start.","Never pay to start a job. Report and block.")
B.a_0=new A.bg(B.bf,B.a8,"Shopping","Login code you just requested","Your login code is 482 910. Never share it with anyone, not even staff. If you did not request this, ignore it.","Saved wallet sender","You tapped \u201cLog in\u201d in the app a minute ago and the sender is the saved wallet name.","Getting a code you asked for is normal. The danger is giving it to someone else.")
B.a_b=new A.bg(B.bf,B.a3,"Entertainment","Concert tickets via DM","Last 2 VIP tickets, 50% off! Bayad muna sa e-wallet para ma-reserve, ipapadala ko ang QR.","Unknown seller","The official ticketing site says tickets are sold only on its own page.","Sold-out concerts attract scammers. Buy only from the official seller.")
B.ZG=new A.bg(B.bE,B.a3,"Shopping","Support \u2022 verified \u2714","A newly created page with a paid badge claims to be customer care and asks people to DM their OTP.","About \u2022 Created 4 days ago","The company says support is handled only inside its app and its listed account.","A badge is not a directory. Check the company\u2019s own list of accounts.")
B.ZV=new A.bg(B.bE,B.a8,"Government","New handle announced by the old page","A new account for a barangay office says it replaced the old handle. The old account\u2019s pinned post announces the move.","About \u2022 Created 5 days ago","The old official page and the city website both link to the new account.","A brand-new account can be the real one when trusted sources confirm it.")
B.a_e=new A.bg(B.bu,B.a8,"Entertainment","Fandom roast, not harassment","Reported: \u201cOverrated ang comeback nila at bagsak ang choreo. Pero mahal ko pa rin ang fans, mababait sila.\u201d","Complaint: \u201cHate speech!\u201d","The comment criticizes a music video and nobody\u2019s identity.","Disliking a comeback is not harassment, however loud the fandom reacts.")
B.ZN=new A.bg(B.bu,B.a3,"Campus","Doxxing a student","Reported: A comment posts a student\u2019s home address and says \u201cpuntahan natin siya ngayong gabi.\u201d","Complaint: \u201cPrivate info\u201d","The comment shares a private address and urges people to go there.","Sharing private details to target someone is never allowed.")
B.ZZ=new A.bg(B.bF,B.a3,"Campus","New bank details for tuition","The accounting office says its old bank account is closed and asks you to send tuition to a new account number. Reply-to is a different address.","Sender looks right, reply-to differs","The school\u2019s portal lists only the original payment channels.","Changes to payment details by email are a classic scam. Confirm through the school directly.")
B.a_q=new A.bg(B.bF,B.a8,"Campus","Enrollment closes Friday","Reminder from the registrar: enrollment closes this Friday, 5PM. Finish on the school portal you already use. We never ask for your password by email.","Registrar address","The school portal lists the same deadline and the link points to the school\u2019s own domain.","Urgent does not mean fake. Check whether the deadline and domain are real.")
B.a_u=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a8,"Government","Short cut, full video linked","A 20-second clip of a council answer, cut from a livestream. The caption links the full video and the question is included.","Full video linked","The full recording says the same thing, with the question and answer intact.","Short clips are normal. What matters is whether the cut changes the meaning.")
B.ZT=new A.bg(B.c7,B.a3,"Government","\u201cWala akong pakialam\u201d clip","A clip cuts a mayor\u2019s answer so he seems to say he does not care about flood victims. The reporter\u2019s question and his denial are removed.","Caption: \u201cHeto ang tunay na ugali\u201d","The full interview shows he was repeating a rumor and then denying it.","Trimming away the question can reverse a meaning. Look for the full recording.")
B.a_d=new A.bg(B.aH,B.a3,"Election","\u201cPartial count\u201d screenshot","Kap. Reyes lamang daw ng 90%! Dinaya ang kalaban. Screenshot ng bilangan ang nakalakip.","Old practice run","The screenshot header shows a test run from an earlier election; the election office says no results are out.","Only the election office\u2019s own release counts as results.")
