B.aei=new A.df("flood_critic","Government","Flooded street photo","Do the numbers it quotes match public records?","Strong criticism of a public project is allowed when the facts it cites are accurate. Asking for accountability is not misinformation.",!1,B.SF,"The flooded-street photo is new: taken yesterday, and a street sign shows Brgy. {town}.","Posted the evening after the rain.","The city's public project list shows a P{amt}M flood wall for Brgy. {town}. The post quotes it correctly.","Residents argue about whether the wall or the drainage is the problem. Heated, but no threats.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.Tc=s(["BREAKING: Aso sa Brgy. {town}, nahalal na Kapitan; nangakong libreng buto para sa lahat \ud83d\udc36\ud83c\udfc6","LATEST: Traffic enforcer sa {city}, ginawaran ng 'Pinakamapagpasensyang Tao ng Taon' matapos ang 3 oras na traffic."],t.s)
B.aeh=new A.df("satire_page","Government","Meme image","Who runs this page, and what do they say they post?","Labeled satire is allowed. The page's bio tells you it's a joke, so context matters.",!1,B.Tc,"An edited meme image carrying the same page's watermark.","Posted this morning, like the page's other jokes.","No news outlet reports this, and the page posts jokes like it every day.","Everyone is laughing and tagging friends.",B.v,B.K,B.v,B.v,'Page bio: "Satire at memes lang. Walang totoo dito \ud83d\ude02". Active for 3 years.',B.M)
B.SS=s(["Jeepney na lumilipad sa ibabaw ng Maynila \ud83d\ude8c\u2728 Ang ganda ng gawa ko!","Binuo ko 'to gamit AI: sampaguita garden sa gitna ng EDSA. Ano sa tingin n'yo?"],t.s)
B.aeb=new A.df("ai_art","AI","Digital artwork","Does the creator say how it was made?","AI images are fine when presented as art. The problem is passing them off as real events.",!1,B.SS,'Creator tagged the image "AI-generated" and posted the prompt in the first comment.',"Posted today with the artist's other digital art.","The creator's portfolio lists it under AI art, not news.","People ask for the prompt. Nobody thinks it's a real photo.",B.M,B.K,B.v,B.v,null,B.K)
B.V0=s(["Reminder: Bukas pa ang {school} scholarship applications, ayon sa school portal. Check the current deadline there.","Pa-share po! Sa latest {school} scholarship portal, ongoing pa ang applications. I-check ang updated deadline sa portal."],t.s)
B.ae7=new A.df("old_valid","Campus","Scholarship poster","Is the date still current on the official page?","An older post isn't automatically outdated. Check whether the information is still current.",!1,B.V0,"The poster is the school's own design from this term.","The post is 3 weeks old.","In this fictional case, the school's current portal confirms applications are still open this term.","Applicants confirm that the portal is still accepting applications.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.R3=s(["{store} seller: 11 days late ang parcel ko, tapos seen-zone pa. Hindi ko inirerekomenda \ud83d\ude24 Resibo ko sa comments.","Warning sa mga bibili sa {store}: 2 weeks na, wala pa rin ang order ko at walang sagot. Screenshots ko po."],t.s)
B.aem=new A.df("review_receipts","Shopping","Order screenshot","Do the receipts back up the complaint?","A negative review with receipts is customer feedback. Disliking a business is not misinformation.",!1,B.R3,"The order screenshot shows an order placed 11 days ago, matching the post.","Posted after the delivery window passed.","The order number in the screenshot matches the shop's own order page.","A few buyers had good experiences; others had the same delay.",B.M,B.K,B.v,B.v,null,B.K)
B.VP=s(["Baha na sa kanto namin sa Brgy. {town}, hanggang tuhod na. Mag-ingat po sa mga dadaan.","Update from Brgy. {town}: umaapaw na ang estero. Iwasan muna ang Rizal St."],t.s)
B.ae5=new A.df("flood_real","Weather","Flooded street","Is the photo new, and does the location match?","A fresh, local photo with matching details can be trusted. Check where and when it was taken.",!1,B.VP,"Photo is new: first seen today at 3:40 PM, and the street sign matches Brgy. {town}.","Posted 20 minutes ago.","The weather bureau's bulletin has a heavy-rain warning for the area today.","Neighbors confirm and add their own photos.",B.M,B.v,B.v,B.v,null,B.K)
B.Um=s(["Hot take: mid ang bagong MV ng {group}, pero stan pa rin ako \ud83d\ude2d Sana mas maganda ang choreo next time.","Unpopular opinion: overrated ang comeback ng {group}. Pero mahal ko pa rin sila, huwag n'yo akong i-cancel \ud83d\ude05"],t.s)
B.aec=new A.df("fan_hot_take","Music","MV screenshot","Is there a factual claim to check at all?","Disliking a music video is not misinformation or harassment. Opinions are allowed.",!1,B.Um,"The screenshot is from the group's official MV.","Posted the day of the MV release.","Nothing to fact-check: it's a personal opinion about a music video.","Fans disagree politely. A few jokes.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.VI=s(["Ayuda payout para sa registered seniors sa Brgy. {town}: bukas 8AM sa covered court. Dalhin ang valid ID at pension slip.","Reminder sa mga senior ng Brgy. {town}: payout bukas 8AM, covered court. Valid ID lang ang kailangan. Detalye: brgy-{town}.example/payout"],t.s)
B.aek=new A.df("ayuda_real","Government","Payout poster","Do the barangay and the welfare office both list it?","Not every ayuda post is a scam. The agency's own pages confirmed the details, and no link or fee was involved.",!1,B.VI,"The poster matches the one used in the barangay's earlier payouts.","Posted the day before the payout.","The barangay's page and the city welfare office both list this payout with the same time and place.","Seniors say they got text reminders from the barangay.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.QS=s(["{outlet}: Signal No. 2 sa 4 na lalawigan habang papalapit ang Bagyong Ligaya.","Ayon sa {outlet}, Signal No. 2 na sa apat na lalawigan dahil sa Bagyong Ligaya. Bulletin: weatherbureau.example/bulletin"],t.s)
B.ae6=new A.df("weather_news","Weather","Weather map","What does the weather bureau bulletin say?","A news report that matches the official bulletin is solid. Reputation matters less than whether it checks out.",!1,B.QS,"A standard bulletin map, with the bureau's usual colors.","Published within the hour of the 5 PM bulletin.","The weather bureau's 5 PM bulletin lists Signal No. 2 for those same provinces.","People tag relatives in the affected areas.",B.v,B.v,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.SI=s(["Nag-post ang anak ni Cong. Villareal ng luxury trip habang lubog ang distrito. Hindi ko sinasabing may ninakaw, pero pwede bang ilabas ang statement of assets para malinaw?","Tanong lang po: ang laki ng gastos sa bakasyon ng anak ni Cong. Villareal. Public official po siya, may karapatan tayong humingi ng transparency."],t.s)
B.aef=new A.df("nepo_question","Government","Vacation photo","Does the post claim a crime, or does it ask for documents?","Asking an official for transparency is allowed. The post claims no crime and shows nothing doctored. Heated politics is not misinformation.",!1,B.SI,"The vacation photo comes from the relative's own public account, posted this week.","Posted two days after the floods, same week as the travel photos.","The post makes no claim of theft. It asks for the official's published asset statement, which is a public document.","Supporters and critics argue; nobody posts threats.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.Vy=s(["{group} leader nag-donate ng \u20b15M sa mga biktima ng bagyo! I-share ang post na ito at makakatanggap ka ng \u20b11,000 sa {wallet}!","Biyaya! Sa bawat share ng post na ito, may \u20b11,000 ka mula sa donation ng {group}. Comment 'SHARE' para ma-register."],t.s)
B.ael=new A.df("celeb_donation","Music","Donation graphic","Did the group or its agency announce a donation?","A donation that pays you for sharing is bait to spread a scam. Check what the person or agency has actually said.",!0,B.Vy,"The donation graphic copies the group's logo but not its usual font; the same graphic appears on other pages.","Posted during the typhoon news cycle.","The group's agency page says it has announced no such donation or giveaway.","Many comment 'SHARE' hoping for money; nobody reports receiving any.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.Sw=s(["SK Youth Day sa Brgy. {town} ngayong Sabado! Libre ang sports clinic at career talk. Walang registration fee. Mag-sign up sa mismong SK table.","Mga kabataan ng Brgy. {town}: SK Youth Day this Saturday, 9AM. Libre lahat. Dalhin lang ang school ID."],t.s)
B.aee=new A.df("sk_event","Campus","Event poster","Does the barangay page confirm the event?","Not every event post is a scam. The barangay's own page matched it and nothing asked for money.",!1,B.Sw,"The poster matches the design the SK page used for earlier events.","Posted four days before the event.","The barangay's page lists the same event, date and 'free' note. No payment link anywhere.","Residents ask about parking; the SK chair answers.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.S4=s(["{queen} said it herself: 'Mga fans ko, pabigat lang kayo.' Eto ang screenshot, huwag n'yo na siyang suportahan!!","EXPOSED! Eto ang tunay na sinabi ni {queen} tungkol sa fans niya. Screenshot, i-share para mabisto!"],t.s)
B.ae1=new A.df("fake_queen_quote","Drag Race","Edited screenshot","Does the queen's own page show that post?","Fandom drama makes edited screenshots spread. The real page says the opposite.",!0,B.S4,"The font in the screenshot is slightly different from the platform's, and the time stamp has an edit artifact.","The original post time doesn't appear on {queen}'s page.","{queen}'s own page has a post from that hour: 'Mahal ko ang fans ko, salamat sa 1M!'","Fans are split; one asks for the link to the original post and gets no answer.",B.M,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.UH=s(["NGAYON LANG! Baha sa {city} dahil sa Bagyong Ligaya, grabe na! \ud83d\ude2d Pa-share para makita ng lahat.","Ito na ang sitwasyon sa {city} ngayon. Hanggang bubong na ang tubig!! Ingat po lahat."],t.s)
B.aea=new A.df("recycled_flood","Weather","Flood photo","When did this photo first appear?","Old disaster photos return every storm season. A real photo can still mislead when it is shown with the wrong date and place.",!0,B.UH,"This photo first appeared in {y1}, during a different storm in another city.","The image file dates to {y1}; the post says it's happening now.","The weather bureau lists no flood warning for {city} today.","One user says: \"Taong {y1} 'yan ah, hindi 'to ngayon.\"",B.M,B.v,B.v,B.v,null,B.K)
B.Tm=s(["SINABI NI {who}: \"Wala akong pakialam sa mga nabaha, bayaran na lang nila ang utang nila.\" Grabe 'tong taong 'to!!","Eto ang tunay na ugali ni {who}. Basahin n'yo ang sinabi niya sa mga biktima \ud83d\ude21 SHARE!"],t.s)
B.ae_=new A.df("fake_quote","Government","News card","Did the outlet on the card actually publish it?","Anger is not evidence. A fake news card can put words in someone's mouth, whether you like that person or not.",!0,B.Tm,"The card's font and logo don't match {outlet}'s real news cards.","Posted at 1 AM, with no link to a full story.","{outlet} says it never published this card. Its website has no such quote.","People are furious, but nobody can link the original interview.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.RT=s(["LIBRE P{amt} PARA SA LAHAT! Walang requirements, mag-register lang sa ayuda-ph-now.example bago mag-12 midnight!","ATTENTION: P{amt} cash aid, first 1,000 lang. I-click ang ayuda-ph-now.example at ilagay ang mobile number."],t.s)
B.ae4=new A.df("fake_ayuda_link","Government","Cash graphic","Does the city or barangay announce this program?","Free cash with a link and a deadline is a classic scam pattern. Check the official page, not the post's own link.",!0,B.RT,"The picture of cash is a stock photo used on other scam posts.","Posted late at night, with a deadline of midnight.",'City Hall posted: "We have no such program. Don\'t click links."',"Some ask for the link, others say they never received anything.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.R1=s(["HIRING na ang Maritime Service PH! Sahod \u20b143,800, walang experience needed. Magbayad lang ng \u20b11,500 processing fee sa {wallet}.","Job openings sa Maritime Service PH! Sahod \u20b143,800/buwan. Reserve your slot, bayad \u20b11,500 sa {wallet}."],t.s)
B.ae2=new A.df("fake_recruitment","Government","Hiring poster","Does the agency charge application fees?","Legit agencies don't charge a fee to apply. A high salary with no requirements is bait.",!0,B.R1,"The poster logo is a low-resolution copy of the agency's logo.","Posted by a page created last week.","The agency's official page says it never charges application fees and lists no such hiring.","Applicants say they paid and were then blocked.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.TV=s(["Si Doc Ramon Alcantara mismo ang nagsabi: itong herbal capsule ang lunas sa ubo at pulmonya. Order na bago maubos! \ud83c\udfa5","Doc Ramon, inamin na! Gamot daw sa lahat ng sakit sa baga ang capsule na ito. Panoorin ang buong video."],t.s)
B.ae0=new A.df("deepfake_doc","Health","Video thumbnail","Does the doctor say this in the original video?","AI can copy a real person's face and voice. A trusted face selling a cure is a reason to check the person's own page.",!0,B.TV,"The doctor's lips and voice don't line up. The original video, from {y1}, is about handwashing.","The audio was added to an older video.",'The doctor\'s official page says: "I never promoted this product. This video is an AI edit."',"Many glowing testimonials, all from new accounts using the same wording.",B.M,B.v,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.TQ=s(["WALANG PASOK BUKAS sa LAHAT ng level sa buong {city}! Galing sa City Hall ang advisory. Share na!","CLASS SUSPENSION: lahat ng paaralan sa {city}, bukas. Screenshot mula sa City Hall. Pakisabi sa mga GC!"],t.s)
B.ae3=new A.df("doctored_screenshot","Weather","Advisory screenshot","Look at the date on the advisory itself.","Old advisories get reposted as new. Check the date on the graphic and the official page.",!0,B.TQ,"A {y1} date is visible in the corner of the advisory graphic.","That advisory was from {y1} and covered one school only.","City Hall's current page has no suspension notice today.","Students say their schools haven't announced anything.",B.M,B.M,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.TX=s(["BREAKING: Lahat ng paaralan sa probinsya, SARADO sa susunod na linggo dahil sa dengue!!","Dengue outbreak! Walang klase ang buong probinsya next week. Pakisabi sa pamilya n'yo!"],t.s)
B.ae9=new A.df("false_scope","Campus","School news photo","What does the real notice actually cover?","Misleading posts often start with something real and then stretch the scope. Compare the claim with the original notice.",!0,B.TX,'The photo is real, but its caption says "one school".',"The news item is from this week.","The real notice is from one school in Brgy. {town}: two days of cleaning after dengue cases.","Parents from other schools say their classes are still on.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.Vq=s(['GHOST PROJECT! Eto ang "flood wall" sa Brgy. {town}, wala naman pala!! Saan napunta ang P{amt}M?? \ud83d\ude21',"Walang flood wall sa Brgy. {town}! Puro damo lang. Ninakaw ang P{amt}M, ipakulong sila!"],t.s)
B.aed=new A.df("ghost_wrong_site","Government","Empty lot photo","Is the photo really from Brgy. {town}?","Corruption is a real issue and worth asking about. But a photo of the wrong place is not proof. Accountability needs accurate evidence.",!0,B.Vq,"The empty lot was photographed two weeks ago in Brgy. {town2}, a different barangay.","The photo is real but is two weeks old.","The city's inspection report shows the Brgy. {town} wall as finished, with dated photos.","Residents say the wall exists, but the old drainage still floods.",B.M,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.Ud=s(["LAST 2 PCS na VIP ticket ng {group} concert! 50% OFF, bayad agad sa {wallet} para ma-reserve. DM lang.","{group} concert tickets, SOLD OUT na sa website pero may stock pa ako. Bayad muna sa {wallet}, ipapadala ang QR."],t.s)
B.aen=new A.df("ticket_resale","Music","Ticket image","Where does the official ticketing site say tickets are sold?","Sold-out concert tickets attract scammers. Check the official seller's rules before paying anyone.",!0,B.Ud,"The QR code on the ticket image also appears on other sellers' posts.","Posted minutes after the official sale sold out.","The official ticketing site says tickets are sold only on its own page, with no resale or DM sales.","Several people say they paid and were blocked.",B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
B.V5=s(["PARTIAL UNOFFICIAL COUNT: Kap. Reyes lamang ng 90%! Dinaya daw ang kalaban, share para mabisto!","BREAKING: Lamang na si Kap. Reyes sa bilangan, 90% ng presinto na! Itinatago ito ng media."],t.s)
B.aeg=new A.df("election_count","Election","Results screenshot","Has the election office released any results yet?","Fake election results spread fast because people are emotional. Only the election office's own release counts.",!0,B.V5,"The screenshot header shows a practice run from {y1}.","The results page was created during {y1}'s test.","The election office says no results have been released yet.","People argue about cheating without linking any official numbers.",B.M,B.v,B.M,B.K,null,B.K)
B.QW=s(["TSUNAMI sa Manila Bay?! Nakuha ng drone kanina. Pa-share para makapaghanda ang lahat \ud83c\udf0a\ud83d\ude31","Grabeng alon sa Manila Bay ngayon lang. Lumikas na kayo!! Kuha ng kaibigan ko."],t.s)
B.aej=new A.df("ai_disaster","AI","Dramatic photo","Where did the picture first appear, and what do official warnings say?","AI images can look dramatic and real. When there's no official warning, don't spread panic.",!0,B.QW,"No camera data. The image first appeared on an AI art page two days ago.","The scene doesn't match today's weather.","The weather bureau and major outlets report no tsunami warning.","Others point out melted text on signs and odd building shapes.",B.M,B.v,B.M,B.v,null,B.K)
