B.acm=new A.h6("labeled_ai","AI","AI parody: barangay robot","A robot barangay captain announces free pandesal for all (AI parody).","AI is fine when it is clearly labeled and nobody real is being impersonated. The label is the deciding fact.","Is the AI use disclosed and obvious?",!1,B.RF,"First uploaded by a comedy page that posts only AI parodies.","The voice is synthetic, and the page says so in its description.",'A comedy page; the bio says "All videos are AI-made".','An on-screen "AI-generated parody" label appears throughout.',B.v,B.v,B.v,B.M,B.v,"The full video is the same parody with the same label.")
