B.acf=new A.h6("fan_edit","Music","Fancam edit","A fan edit that cuts together the best moments of the {group} concert.","Edits that don't claim to be something else aren't misleading. A fan edit doesn't need to be removed.","Does the video claim to be anything other than what it is?",!1,B.UP,"Uploaded by a fan page after the concert, labeled as a fan edit.","Music is the group's song; there is no added speech.",'A fan account that says "Unofficial fan edit".','The description says: "Fan edit, not official footage."',B.v,B.v,B.K,B.M,B.v,"Longer fan video showing the same songs in order.")
