B.T0=s(["The portal says allowances are released free. You report the number \u2705"],t.s)
B.Sc=s(["The allowance never comes, and they ask for more fees.","Fake IDs are easy to make."],t.s)
B.ac1=new A.eE("scholar_fee","Scholarship Admin","+63 955 \u2022\u2022\u2022 1824",!0,B.VQ,B.S_,"",'An unknown number using the word "admin".',"Check the official portal or office; don't send anything",B.RS,B.T0,B.Sc,"Real scholarships don't charge fees to release money. The official portal said so.","Where did the scholarship office say allowances are released?")
B.Te=s(["{courier}: May parcel kang naka-hold sa hub. Magbayad ng \u20b1{amt} shipping sa {wallet} namin bago mag-deliver."],t.s)
B.Ub=s(["You haven't ordered anything this week.","Your orders list: nothing on the way."],t.s)
B.Tz=s(["Pay the \u20b1{amt} to be safe","Reply and ask what the parcel is"],t.s)
B.SU=s(["No orders on the way. You delete the text and report it \u2705"],t.s)
B.SA=s(["The money is gone and no parcel ever arrives.","Replying tells them the number is live."],t.s)
B.ac8=new A.eE("parcel_hub_pay","{courier}","+63 949 \u2022\u2022\u2022 5509",!0,B.Te,B.Ub,"","A number that is not on any of your orders.","Check your orders in the shopping app, and don't pay",B.Tz,B.SU,B.SA,"No order, a number you don't know, and an outside payment are the classic parcel-scam signs.","Did you order anything?")
B.Ts=s(["KARGO EXPRESS: Failed delivery. Your parcel is on hold. Pay \u20b1{amt} redelivery fee within 2 hours or it will be returned: {link}"],t.s)
B.Td=s(["You haven't ordered anything this week.","Your order list: no pending deliveries."],t.s)
B.Su=s(["Tap the link to see how much the fee really is",'Reply "STOP" to unsubscribe from the messages'],t.s)
B.VS=s(["You open the app. No orders and no failed deliveries. You delete the text and report the number \u2705"],t.s)
B.RI=s(["The link opens a page asking for card details.","Replying also tells the sender your number is active."],t.s)
B.abZ=new A.eE("parcel_fee","Kargo Express","+63 905 \u2022\u2022\u2022 7712",!0,B.Ts,B.Td,"kargo-redeliver-fee.example","A new number you have never saved.","Check your orders in the shopping app yourself, and ignore the link",B.Su,B.VS,B.RI,"There was no order, the link domain wasn't the courier's, and the fee was urgent. Check your own app, not the link.","Did you order anything? Who owns that link domain?")
B.V6=s(["Hi, ako si Rico from {wallet} Security. May nag-login sa account mo sa Cebu. Para ma-block, paki-send ang 6-digit code na ipapadala namin sa'yo ngayon."],t.s)
B.Vh=s(["You haven't tried to log in anywhere right now.","No security alert in the {wallet} app."],t.s)
B.Tn=s(['Send the code so the "security team" can block the login',"Ask for his employee ID and keep chatting"],t.s)
B.Rr=s(["The app shows no alert. You block the number and report it \u2705"],t.s)
B.Uk=s(["That code is the key to your wallet. The scammer logs in and empties it.","Chatting longer gives them time to pressure you."],t.s)
B.ac7=new A.eE("otp_call","Unknown","+63 917 \u2022\u2022\u2022 3009",!0,B.V6,B.Vh,"",u.P,"Hang up or stop replying. Check the alert inside the app yourself",B.Tn,B.Rr,B.Uk,"Real security teams never ask you to read out a code. The code is what lets them in.","Would a real company ask for your code?")
B.QU=s(["Hi, si Ate Joy 'to! Nasira phone ko kaya bagong number. Pwede mo ba muna akong utangan ng \u20b1{amt}? Bayaran ko mamaya. Huwag ka na tumawag, mahina ang signal."],t.s)
B.VN=s(["Ate Joy's saved number is different from this one.","Her last post in the family group was 2 hours ago."],t.s)
B.VL=s(["Send the money now, since family comes first",'Ask "Ano apelyido mo?" and send if she answers'],t.s)
B.V2=s(['Ate Joy answers her usual number: "Ha? Hindi ako \'yan!" You warn the family group \u2705'],t.s)
B.R4=s(["The money is gone and the number stops replying.","Scammers often know the family's surnames already."],t.s)
B.abS=new A.eE("relative_new_number",'"Ate Joy"',"+63 936 \u2022\u2022\u2022 5502",!0,B.QU,B.VN,"","Unsaved number using your cousin's first name.","Call Ate Joy's saved number or ask in the family group first",B.VL,B.V2,B.R4,"A new number plus pressure not to call is a classic. Confirm through a contact channel you already trust.","Is there a way to reach the real person on a number you already have?")
B.QQ=s(["Hello! Part-time online job, \u20b1{amt}/day lang sa pag-like ng videos. Walang experience needed. Magdeposito muna ng \u20b11,000 para ma-activate ang account mo, ibabalik din."],t.s)
B.TS=s(["You didn't apply for any online job.","Your student email has no applications pending."],t.s)
B.VF=s(["Pay the \u20b11,000 first, since it's refundable",'Ask for a screenshot of their "company" first'],t.s)
B.QZ=s(["You report the number and your classmates thank you for the heads-up \u2705"],t.s)
B.TW=s(['The first "task" pays \u20b150. Then they ask for a bigger deposit, and the account is frozen.',"Fake screenshots are easy to make."],t.s)
B.ac0=new A.eE("task_job","Job Offer","+63 947 \u2022\u2022\u2022 6618",!0,B.QQ,B.TS,"quickjobs-ph.example","A number that found you out of nowhere.","Don't pay anything. Report and block",B.VF,B.QZ,B.TW,"Jobs that charge you to start, or pay a lot for liking videos, are a common scam pattern.","Who asks a worker to pay money first?")
B.VK=s(["CONGRATULATIONS! Nanalo ka ng \u20b1{amt} sa {wallet} Anniversary Raffle! I-claim ngayon: {link}. Ilagay ang MPIN para ma-verify."],t.s)
B.Sk=s(["You didn't join any raffle.","The {wallet} app has no promo like this."],t.s)
B.Ve=s(["Tap the link, but just look without typing anything","Reply to ask if it's real"],t.s)
B.UK=s(["The app has no such promo. You delete the text \u2705"],t.s)
B.SD=s(["Even opening an unknown link can load a fake login page.","Replying tells them your number is live."],t.s)
B.abT=new A.eE("raffle_prize","{wallet} Promo","+63 915 \u2022\u2022\u2022 4120",!0,B.VK,B.Sk,"pesogo-claim-prize.example",u.P,"Ignore the link and delete the message. Report it as phishing",B.Ve,B.UK,B.SD,"You can't win a raffle you never joined, and no real raffle asks for your MPIN.","Did you enter this raffle?")
B.VE=s(["FINAL NOTICE: May unpaid traffic violation ka na \u20b1{amt}. Bayaran within 24 hrs o lalaki ang penalty: {link}"],t.s)
B.SC=s(["You don't drive and have no registered vehicle.","No traffic ticket was ever issued to you."],t.s)
B.TH=s(["Pay through the link just to be safe","Send a screenshot to the GC and ask if you should pay"],t.s)
B.S6=s(["The official site shows no violation under your name \u2705"],t.s)
B.VW=s(["Paying through the link sends the money straight to the scammer.","Your GC may reply with advice, but the money is still gone if you paid."],t.s)
B.ac2=new A.eE("lto_fine","Traffic Fine","+63 927 \u2022\u2022\u2022 9984",!0,B.VE,B.SC,"traffic-fines-pay.example","An unsaved mobile number.","Check the official traffic website by typing it yourself",B.TH,B.S6,B.VW,"A fine for something you never did, with a short deadline and an outside link, is a red flag.","Did you actually get a ticket?")
B.SH=s(["Hi Ms./Mr. {name}, order #R{id} sa {store} ay na-hold dahil kulang ang address. Pakiverify ang card details dito: {link}"],t.s)
B.Vk=s(["Yesterday: you did place an order on {store} (\u20b1{amt}).","Your app shows: Order confirmed, address complete."],t.s)
B.S5=s(["Verify through the link, since they know your order","Reply with the first 6 digits of your card to prove it's you"],t.s)
B.SM=s(["The app says your order is fine and the address is complete \u2705"],t.s)
B.Tr=s(["Scammers can buy leaked order data. Knowing your name doesn't make them the store.","Even partial card numbers help them."],t.s)
B.ac5=new A.eE("bank_known_details","Order Update","+63 918 \u2022\u2022\u2022 7731",!0,B.SH,B.Vk,"store-verify-order.example","Knows your name and a real order, but it is an unsaved number.","Check the order in the {store} app yourself, and don't use the link",B.S5,B.SM,B.Tr,"A real order doesn't make a message real. The app shows no problem, and the link isn't the store's.","What does your own order page say?")
B.UY=s(["NOTICE: Your SIM will be deactivated in 24 hours. To keep your number, reply with a photo of your ID and your birthday."],t.s)
B.Ue=s(["Your SIM was registered when you bought it.","Your network app shows: SIM registered \u2713."],t.s)
B.Vp=s(["Send a photo of your ID so you do not lose your number","Ask them to confirm your name first"],t.s)
B.U8=s(["The app says your SIM is registered. You delete the text \u2705"],t.s)
B.Ty=s(["A photo of your ID and birthday is enough for someone to open accounts in your name.","Scammers can fake any confirmation."],t.s)
B.abW=new A.eE("sim_register","SIM Notice","+63 960 \u2022\u2022\u2022 3317",!0,B.UY,B.Ue,"","A mobile number, not your network's sender name.","Check your SIM status in your network's app yourself",B.Vp,B.U8,B.Ty,"Your own app says the SIM is registered. A text that asks for an ID photo by reply is collecting your identity.","What does your own network app say?")
